# Job (STAGE 2, approved B): cpp — pre-admission route retry exhaustion must end as `Unavailable`, not `DeadlineExceeded`

You are a codex sub-agent under a Claude supervisor. Read `AGENTS.md` (root) §3 (계층 소유권·금지 패턴·교차언어 대조) and
